# Film 2 of still.fail in use on the iPhone Duo simulator, in Chinese: a picture marked up and sent back (story
# scripts/story/iduo-mark-zh.json, FILM_LANG=zh FILM_STORY=iduo-mark-zh).
timeout 45000
until 发消息
# (the film once the app is on the screen as it stays: its first frames, as it starts, are none of the story)
wait 1200
at start
wait 1500
# (the list open over the chat as the outer screen lights: the chat tapped where it shows at the right, the list goes)
at tap=chat
tapxy 430 330
wait 1200
at tap=发消息
tap 发消息
wait 900
at keys0
pinyin denglu|登录
wait 160
pinyin anniu|按钮
wait 160
pinyin zai|在
wait 160
pinyin anse|暗色
wait 160
pinyin moshi|模式
wait 160
pinyin xia|下
wait 160
pinyin kanbuqing|看不清
wait 160
type ，
wait 200
pinyin xiuyixia|修一下
wait 160
wait 450
at tap=send
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 500
at kb-down
# (the keyboard left up as one does after sending: no tap on the list to put it away)
wait 600
at working
wait 2000
until 找到了
# (the answer coming in: the keyboard put away to read it, a while after sending, not at once)
wait 1200
tapxy 250 140
until 退出登录
at answer
wait 1500
at unfold
log UNFOLD
wait 4500
at pic
tap img:改后
wait 2000
at mark
nav over/mark 902 260
wait 900
at draw
drag 378 466 110 40 500
wait 900
at comment
wait 600
at keys
pinyin haishi|还是
wait 160
pinyin kanbuqing|看不清
wait 160
wait 700
at note-done
tap 完成
wait 900
at offer
tap 添加到对话
wait 1200
at tap=send2
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 500
at working2
until 看得准
at fixed
wait 1500
at tap=合并
tap =合并
until 4f2a9c1
at merged
wait 3200
at end
exit
